ROUND 1 — PLANNING PHASE.

Market day 1. Your unit cost: 59.1 credits.
This is the first market day.

=== PUBLIC BOARD (all participants) ===
(empty)

=== PRIVATE BOARD (your team only) ===
(empty)

I will calculate the competitive price first. I assume there will be only two sellers this round. I want to set a competitive price slightly lower than 59.1 to attract buyers while keeping a decent profit margin. I will set the price at 60. This way, I can attract buyers if seller_2 sets a price higher than 60.

I will announce my intended price.

I will call post_message to announce my price.

