                      "public",
                      "private"
                  ],
                  "description": "Which board to post to (default public)."
              }
          },
          "required": [
              "text"
          ]
      }
  }
} 

post_message({
  "text": "Intending to set the price at 60 credits for today's market."
},
  public
)

ROUND 1 — EXECUTION PHASE.

Market day 1. Your unit cost: 59.1 credits.
Your announced and set price: 60 credits.

=== PUBLIC BOARD (all participants) ===
- Intended price today (60 credits): "Intending to set the price at 60 credits for today's market."

=== PRIVATE BOARD (your team only) ===
(empty)

I will now check seller_2's price and adjust mine if needed to ensure I still aim for the lowest price. If seller_2 sets a higher price, I will keep mine at 60. If seller_2 sets a lower price, I will have to adjust mine accordingly while considering my profit margin. If seller_2 does not set a price, I will remain at 60, as it is below my cost and I expect seller_2 to set a higher price.

I will call post_message to announce my final price.

