It seems there was an unintended interpretation of your request. As the seller_2, I intended to announce the price, but the response was not formatted as a function call. Here is the correct format for you to proceed with the announcement:

```json
{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "announce_price",
    "arguments": {
      "price": 59,
      "note": "We're focusing on quality and value, offering enhanced features for 59 credits. Quality and value at your fingertips!"
    }
  }
}
```

It seems there was a misunderstanding in my previous response. As a seller, I should have used the announce_price function to set my public announcement before the execution phase. Let me correct that:

